{"bangumi":{"date":"1988-07-16","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/4f/fb/5118_bhfEM.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/4f/fb/5118_bhfEM.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/4f/fb/5118_bhfEM.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/4f/fb/5118_bhfEM.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/4f/fb/5118_bhfEM.jpg"},"summary":"　　1988年7月，关东地区使用新型炸弹进行爆破，第三次世界大战即刻爆发。31年后，人类从一片废墟中重建都市，东京湾上建立了巨大城市——新东京。世界仿佛要恢复到以前的繁荣。\r\n　　2019年的一个夜晚，新东京郊外的封闭高速公路上，暴走族团体正在公路上飙车。带头的少年，是一名叫做金田的职业高中学生。\r\n　　突然，街上出现了一位奇怪的矮个子男子，暴走族少年铁雄为躲避车祸连人带车飞出公路。正当金田要拿那位男子问罪之时，军队驾驶直升飞机赶到，将那位矮个男子与铁雄一起收押。\r\n　　铁雄进入了一个陌生的地方，这里似乎在从事超能力的研究。而金田则在盘算如何营救铁雄。二人都不知道，他们的未来，因为神秘力量——阿基拉而已经开始了巨大的变化。","name":"AKIRA","name_cn":"阿基拉","tags":[{"name":"大友克洋","count":1887,"total_count":6362},{"name":"剧场版","count":1615,"total_count":730984},{"name":"科幻","count":1206,"total_count":255953},{"name":"1988","count":946,"total_count":6895},{"name":"漫画改","count":504,"total_count":873777},{"name":"末日","count":462,"total_count":1289},{"name":"科学与毁灭","count":427,"total_count":427},{"name":"akira","count":405,"total_count":405},{"name":"阿基拉","count":354,"total_count":355},{"name":"硬科幻","count":323,"total_count":642},{"name":"TMS","count":299,"total_count":18490},{"name":"超能力","count":213,"total_count":25985},{"name":"漫改","count":167,"total_count":364643},{"name":"神作","count":147,"total_count":48103},{"name":"日本","count":115,"total_count":303859},{"name":"SF","count":113,"total_count":7241},{"name":"动画电影","count":83,"total_count":44204},{"name":"赛博朋克","count":45,"total_count":12498},{"name":"TMSEntertainment","count":33,"total_count":2329},{"name":"映画","count":32,"total_count":6313},{"name":"80年代","count":29,"total_count":2231},{"name":"经典","count":28,"total_count":23216},{"name":"战斗","count":23,"total_count":478236},{"name":"1988年","count":23,"total_count":304},{"name":"原创","count":22,"total_count":627985},{"name":"电影","count":22,"total_count":13666},{"name":"